{"meta":{"ph":"trend; NAmE trend","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"a general direction in which a situation is changing or developing 趋势；趋向；倾向；动态；动向","ex":[{"s":"What trend in DIY does the research show?","src":"2023全国甲卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"研究显示DIY的趋势是什么?"},{"s":"For instance, you might hear someone say: “It’s cold this winter, so I needn’t worry about global warming.”Another is that loud and urgent matters are given too much importance, making people ignore longer-term trends that arguably matter more.","src":"2023北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"例如，你可能听到有人说：“今年冬天很冷，所以我不用为全球变暖担心。”另一个问题是，喧闹而紧迫的事被赋予过多重要性，使人们忽视了 arguably 更重要的长期趋势。"},{"s":"To follow the latest trend.","src":"2022新高考I卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"遵循最新趋势。"},{"s":"Now a team of researchers led by Damián Blasi at the University of Zurich, Switzerland, has found how and why this trend arose.","src":"2022全国新高考I卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"如今，由瑞士苏黎世大学的达米安·布拉西领导的研究团队，发现了这一趋势产生的方式和原因。"},{"s":"To follow the latest trend.","src":"2022浙江卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"遵循最新趋势。"},{"s":"In the past few years, an increasing number of people and organisations have begun coming up with plans to counter this trend.","src":"2021浙江6月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"过去几年里，越来越多的人和组织开始提出计划来遏制这一趋势。"},{"s":"Collapseology, the study of collapse, is more concerned with identifying trends and with them the dangers of everyday civilization.","src":"2021北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"崩溃学，即研究崩溃的学科，更关注识别趋势以及随之而来的日常文明的危险。"},{"s":"A rising trend of living in the UK.","src":"2020全国III卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"英国一种日益增长的居住趋势。"},{"s":"Craftsmen Set the Trends for Artists","src":"2020北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"工匠为艺术家定下潮流"},{"s":"The trend of having meals alone.","src":"2019全国II卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"独自吃饭的趋势。"},{"s":"Even their hairstyles became major trends at that time.","src":"2019浙江卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"甚至他们的发型当时也成了主流潮流。"},{"s":"But phytoplankton are vulnerable to the ocean's warming trend.","src":"2019北京卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"但浮游植物容易受到海洋变暖趋势的影响。"},{"s":"Interestingly，this trend isn’t evident in baseball. where additional individual talent keeps improving the team’s performance.","src":"2019北京卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"有趣的是，这种趋势在棒球中并不明显，在那里额外的个人天赋会持续提升球队表现。"},{"s":"following the latest world trend       B. getting international recognition","src":"2018全国III卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"B. 获得国际承认"},{"s":"To be sure, more than half of teens still engage in these activities, but the ___44___ have slimmed considerably, Between 1976 and 1979, 86 percent of high school seniors had gone on a date; between 2010 and 2015 only 63 percent People say, Oh, it's because teenagers are more responsible, or more lazy, or more boring, “but they're ___45___ the larger trend,” said Jean Twenge, lead author of the study, which drew on seven large time-lag surveys of Americans.","src":"2018上海卷·Section A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"当然,有一半以上的青少年仍在从事这些活动,但是他们已经大大____44____地萎缩了,在1976年和1979年间,86%的高中高年级学生在某个日期;在2010年和2015年间,只有63%的人说,哦,这是因为青少年更负责任,或更懒惰,或更无聊,“但他们是更大的趋势,____45____”研究的主要作者让·特温格(Jean Twinge)说,该研究借鉴了对美国人的7个大计时调查。"},{"s":"There has been a recent trend in the food service industry toward lower fat content and less salt.","src":"2017全国I卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"近来食品服务业出现了降低脂肪含量和减少盐用量的趋势。"},{"s":"In southern Spain the sudden increase of greenhouses (which reflect light back to space) has changed the warming trend locally, and actually cooled the region.","src":"2017江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"在西班牙南部，温室（把光反射回太空）的突然增加在局部改变了变暖趋势，实际上让该地区变凉了。"},{"s":"If current trends don’t bend, Russia’s population will be about the size of Yemen’s by the year 2050.","src":"2017江苏卷·Population Change","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"如果当前趋势不扭转，到2050年俄罗斯人口将和也门差不多大。"},{"s":"The numbers might sound small, but they are the leading edge of a dangerous trend.","src":"2017北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"这些数字听起来可能很小，但它们是一种危险趋势的前沿。"},{"s":"a small number of measles cases can start a dangerous trend","src":"2017北京卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"少量麻疹病例就可能引发一种危险趋势"},{"s":"Art exhibitions can have many themes, such as a historical period, a location or a trend.","src":"外研社B4 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"艺术展览可以有许多主题,如历史时期,地点或趋势."},{"s":"Instead of replying with a simple “OK, don’t rush”, I searched for emojis on my phone that would express the same message: (picture 2) This was my attempt to follow the trend of communicating with emojis.","src":"外研社B5 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"我没有简单回一句“好的，别急”，而是在手机上找能表达同样意思的表情符号：（图2）这是我追随用表情符号交流潮流的尝试。"},{"s":"Never silent herself in the face of destructive trends, Rachel Carson fed a spring of awareness across America and beyond.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"面对破坏性的趋势,雷切尔·卡森从未沉默过,在全美国和其他地区,他养活了一阵觉悟的春天."},{"s":"Background information Bill Cunningham (1929–2016) was an American fashion photographer, known for his shots of emerging trends on the streets of New York City.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"背景资料比尔·坎宁安(Bill Cunningham)(1929年–2016年)是一位美国时尚摄影师,以拍摄纽约市街头新兴趋势的镜头而闻名."},{"s":"Trend of Chinese college graduates starting a business 1 What options do college students have after graduation?","src":"外研社B7 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"中国大学生毕业生创业趋势 1 大学生毕业后有哪些选择?."}]}]}